00:04:57,391 --> 00:05:03,391
They call themselves "The Goonies." The secret caves. The old lighthouse. The lost map.
The treacherous traps. The hidden adventure. And Sloth… Join the adventure.

2
00:09:54,782 --> 00:10:00,782
The Goonies is a adventure, comedy, family film directed by Richard Donner.

3
00:14:52,173 --> 00:14:58,173
Young teen Mikey Walsh and his friends set off on a quest to find Pirate One-Eyed
Willie's treasure in hopes of saving their homes from demolition.

4
00:19:49,565 --> 00:19:55,565
However, on their quest to find the treasure, they run into a family of recently escaped
criminals, determined to capture the kids and reach the treasure first.

5
